	And the user with the email address "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken" should be a member of the okta group "Systems - Provisioning"

Scenario: Remove employee from Account Access EU team via Sync from Okta
	New Liferay employees who are added to koroneiki via okta and provisioning not in the Account Access EU group should be removed after Sync From Okta button click on provisioning.

	Given I create a user with the following parameters
	| Screen Name   | okt.employee1                    |
	| Email Address | okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken |
	| First Name    | OKT                              |
	| Last Name     | Employee1                        |
	| Group         | Employees                        |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "${staticProvisioningAdminEmailAddress}" with password "${staticProvisioningAdminPassword}"
	And I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Liferay,"
	And I click on the account with the name "Liferay, Inc." on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "Teams" tab
	And I search the accounts details page using the keyword "Account Access EU"
	And I click on the "Account Access EU" team link
	And I search the team details page using the keyword "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"
	Then I should not be able to view the team member with the email address "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"
	When I click on the assign members button
	And I assign the team member with the email address "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"
	And I search the team details page using the keyword "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"
	Then I should be able to view the team member with the email address "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken" and the following values
	| Name          | OKT Employee1                    |
	| Email Address | okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken |
	| Status        | VERIFIED                         |
	When I click on the Sync from Okta button on the team page
	And I search the team details page using the keyword "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"
	Then I should not be able to view the team member with the email address "okt.employee1@liferay.com.broken"

